# R-Type Delta: HD Boosted (PPSA26414) -- EXPLORATORY arm v1 (options + cross mash).
#
# Purpose: find out where the title's own flow goes when the two menu buttons are pressed. It is a
# probe, not a claim; the measured route is reach-gameplay.pad.
#
# OPTIONS is the title screen's own prompt. The title screen renders "PRESS <glyph>" and the glyph
# is the PS5 OPTIONS icon -- a filled vertical pill with three horizontal lines above it -- read off
# assets/screenshots/rtype-delta-title.webp at 1060,740-1180,870 magnified 4x. It is NOT Cross.
#
# Anchors are SECONDS from the FIRST PAD POLL (prosper/src/input/pad.cpp: a bare number is seconds,
# 'f' is flips, 'p' is pad reads). Windows are 0.3 s so a press cannot be missed by a poll gap while
# staying far below a menu's auto-repeat interval.
